### 2026-10-17 (UTC) — first baseline
- baseline created over 17 tables — data written BEFORE this point is not covered by it

### 2026-10-17 (UTC) — a13-defs-decide: add the schema, import export, fixed answers, examples, score log and Jev wire tables
